 at a time of jealousy and envy and gossip

200
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:20,040
 and selfishness and ego.

201
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:22,320
 The greatest threat to Christian communities

202
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:25,600
 is often not external, it's internal, right?

203
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,840
 And it's true all over the country.

204
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:27,960
 I mean, I live in Washington, D.C.

205
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:31,120
 There's massive churches that at some point,

206
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:33,160
 some generation, believed God, trusted,

207
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:35,360
 began to gather and then built this monument

